  "content": "<p><strong>喜歡毛茸茸的生物嗎？那麼鯊魚怎麼樣呢？試試玩這個模組吧！你會玩得很開心的 ;)</strong><br><br>這個模組具備以下功能！<strong><br></strong></p><p>- 改變鯊鯊的外觀<br>- 每種鯊鯊外觀的特殊能力<br>- 鯊鯊與瘋狂鯊鯊之間的區別<br><br>你完全有資格馴服鯊鯊 :D</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">也請看看其他模組！</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-give-me-a-more\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1309851/description_0ded32c8-a091-4a87-9f1b-e96f83006441.png\" width=\"130\" height=\"130\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/do-you-like-sharks-uwu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1309851/description_950b31ce-47ba-43d8-96cb-5e0176f4841b.png\" width=\"130\" height=\"130\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stars-and-moons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1309851/description_6ef9e455-fcf6-4b73-9673-03b3000f24db.png\" width=\"130\" height=\"130\"></a></p>",
